  "content": "# 更好的火焰粒子\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Tschipcraft/better_flame_particles/stargazers\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Tschipcraft/better_flame_particles?logo=github&colorA=181712&colorB=fff5c6&style=for-the-badge\" title=\"GitHub 星标\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-flame-particles\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/782814?logo=curseforge&label=CurseForge&colorA=181712&colorB=fff5c6&style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Tschipcraft/better_flame_particles/releases/latest\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Tschipcraft/better_flame_particles/total?logo=github&colorA=181712&colorB=fff5c6&style=for-the-badge\" title=\"GitHub 下载量\"></a>\n\n> 适用于 1.14.x-26.2.x 版本的资源包\n\n## 功能特性\n\n_见证火焰舞动闪烁的迷人动画。_\n\n此资源包将火焰、灵魂火焰和铜火焰的粒子替换为动画版本。\n\n## 预览\n<p>\n  <img alt=\"动画火焰粒子\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/better_flame_particles/master/demo.gif\" style=\"image-rendering:crisp-edges\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n  <img alt=\"动画灵魂火焰粒子\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/better_flame_particles/master/demo2.gif\" style=\"image-rendering:crisp-edges\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n  <img alt=\"动画铜火焰粒子\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/better_flame_particles/master/demo3.gif\" style=\"image-rendering:crisp-edges\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n</p>\n\n## 兼容性\n\n此资源包会覆盖火焰粒子。非常见风格的资源包与之搭配可能会显得格格不入。\n\n<img title=\"支持的Minecraft版本\" src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/supported?untested_versions=26.3&supported_versions=1.14,1.15,1.16,1.17,1.18,1.19,1.20,1.21,26.1,26.2&total_versions=%3C=1.13,1.14,1.15,1.16,1.17,1.18,1.19,1.20,1.21,26.1,26.2,26.3&progress_bar=false&mc_background=false&icons=true&platform=modrinth\">\n\n## 外部链接\n\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-flame-particles\">\n<img width=\"40px\" alt=\"CurseForge 图标\" title=\"在 CurseForge 上查看更好的火焰粒子\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/badges/main/assets/curseforge-modrinth.svg\">\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/better-flame-particles/\">\n<img width=\"40px\" alt=\"PlanetMinecraft 图标\" title=\"在 PlanetMinecraft 上查看更好的火焰粒子\" src=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/images/layout/favicon-128.png\">\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/C0C5HEJB2\">\n<img width=\"250px\" title=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/brandasset/kofi_button_red.png\">\n</a>\n\n## 合作推广\n\n想要购买 **Hytale** 或升级版本？结账时使用创作者代码 `Tschipcraft`，我将获得佣金！（您的价格保持不变）\n\n<a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=2611\">\n<img title=\"通过 Sparked Host 购买服务器支持我吧（这是联盟链接）\" src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/partner/sparked_banner.png\">\n</a>",
